{"title":"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2022 AMC 10A #7</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">2022 AMC 12A #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Remark\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Remark</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_(Smart_and_Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 (Smart and Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TechMath_Thinker\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TechMath Thinker</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The least common multiple of a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb1b41850ab676e4d1cf15c69b1609af4befbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, and the greatest common divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e22f521187581b4570dbc5ed89bdc6423c1120.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 8 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 9 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c20ac4d93db66c3f4d014bea945f1985fdd72ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 18 &amp;= 2\\cdot3^2, \\\\ 180 &amp;= 2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5, \\\\ 45 &amp;= 3^2\\cdot5 \\\\ 15 &amp;= 3\\cdot5. \\end{align*}\" width=\"122\" height=\"95\" />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aaded4649f73b69b6a8783138bcffacbedff2e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^a\\cdot3^b\\cdot5^c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"17\" /> It follows that:\n</p>\n<ol style=\"margin-left: 1.5em;\">\n  <li>From the least common multiple condition, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a8b85578b0aaa3d09f855daf23059df7f690af7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\operatorname{lcm}(n,18) = \\operatorname{lcm}(2^a\\cdot3^b\\cdot5^c,2\\cdot3^2) = 2^{\\max(a,1)}\\cdot3^{\\max(b,2)}\\cdot5^{\\max(c,0)} = 2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5,\\]\" width=\"543\" height=\"21\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a467710c7efd13540b38c4b31da67aec8fadd2bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2, b\\in\\{0,1,2\\},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/2/7728cb3715e1998da5e398225339c56fa553e7ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n  </p><li>From the greatest common divisor condition, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/4078791e2e129becb18f8794af14ff7fac594ec7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\gcd(n,45) = \\gcd(2^2\\cdot3^b\\cdot5,3^2\\cdot5) = 2^{\\min(2,0)}\\cdot3^{\\min(b,2)}\\cdot5^{\\min(1,1)} = 3\\cdot5,\\]\" width=\"497\" height=\"21\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/d/98d3eeac9520047108762791aeae57bd879f0327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p></ol>\n<p>Together, we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054525fe66fae0ad2b62401d64e0099852d4c56c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2^2\\cdot3\\cdot5=60.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"17\" /> The sum of its digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/9/de934634f22a18ecd7cd486e883417280467f8d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+0=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 6}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"127\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM ~USAMO333\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The options for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50ff5ac473fd73cb14fefe52062af5f79c175b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{lcm}(x, 18)=180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb1b41850ab676e4d1cf15c69b1609af4befbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. The options for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/2/162210c907575288855bbe5627b1cb234a2dd2bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{gcd}(y, 45)=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, etc. We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> appears in both lists; therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce10161a30c5fc7e9947a895f76113487c74e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+0=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~MrThinker\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Remark\">Remark</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Remark\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If you ignore or mess up the LCM, and get  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21cee94ee92654e843d9cf2f18541e37eab00b47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, you'll still get the correct answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YI1E8C3ZX-U\">https://youtu.be/YI1E8C3ZX-U</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/q2y-Wfdi4q8\">https://youtu.be/q2y-Wfdi4q8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_3_.28Smart_and_Simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3_(Smart_and_Simple)\">Video Solution 3 (Smart and Simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3 (Smart and Simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7yAh4MtJ8a8?si=o-aImrVOwbH1HoZv&amp;t=673\">https://youtu.be/7yAh4MtJ8a8?si=o-aImrVOwbH1HoZv&amp;t=673</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5KAiNlqbrsQ\">https://youtu.be/5KAiNlqbrsQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TechMath_Thinker\">Video Solution by TechMath Thinker</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TechMath Thinker\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2dygaQuBb2I\">https://youtu.be/2dygaQuBb2I</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A\">2022 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a hre